      "  \"text\": [",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"expertise of researchers (in years) to explore whether the automated tool would be more useful, the less research experience researchers had.\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 1,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 1,",
      "      \"section_id\": 1,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"We also asked researchers to rate how useful they found the checklist or app on a scale from 1 (not at all) to 7 (extremely useful).\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 2,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 1,",
      "      \"section_id\": 1,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"Data and analysis code is available on GitHub from https://github.com/Lak-ens/to_err_is_human and from https://researchbox.org/4377.\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 3,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 2,",
      "      \"section_id\": 2,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"Data is also available from https://osf.io/5tbm9 and code is also available from https://osf.io/629bx.\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 4,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 3,",
      "      \"section_id\": 2,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"We conducted a sensitivity power analysis 2 to determine that a Cohen's d of 0.50 is the smallest effect size that we could detect with N = 50 participants in each group and 80% power.\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 5,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 4,",
      "      \"section_id\": 3,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"We simulated the data using Faux (DeBruine 2025) (Table 1, Figure 1).\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 6,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 5,",
      "      \"section_id\": 4,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"2 The code we used for this analysis is as follows. pwr::pwr.t.test(n = 50, power = 0.8, alternative = \\\"greater\\\") On average researchers in the experimental (app) condition made fewer mistakes (M = 9.12) than researchers in the control (checklist) condition (M = 10.9), t(97.7) = 2.9, p = 0.005, d =0.59.\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 7,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 5,",
      "      \"section_id\": 4,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"On average researchers in the experimental condition found the app marginally significantly more useful (M = 5.06) than researchers in the control condition found the checklist (M = 4.5), t(97.2) = -1.96, p =0.152.\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 8,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 6,",
      "      \"section_id\": 4,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"There was no effect of experience on the reduction in errors when using the tool (p > .05), as the correlation was non-significant (Figure 2).\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 9,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 7,",
      "      \"section_id\": 4,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"Since our data are simulated for demonstration purposes, of course they confirm our hypotheses.\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 10,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 8,",
      "      \"section_id\": 5,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"It seems automated tools can help prevent errors by providing researchers with feedback about potential mistakes, and researchers feel the app\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 11,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 8,",
      "      \"section_id\": 5,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"Figure 1: The simulated data.\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 12,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 9,",
      "      \"section_id\": null,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"Figure 2: The effect of experience on the reduction in errors.\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 13,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 10,",
      "      \"section_id\": null,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    },",
      "    {",
      "      \"text\": \"Table 1: The average number of mistakes and usefulness score for the control and experimental conditions.\",",
      "      \"text_id\": 14,",
      "      \"paragraph_id\": 11,",
      "      \"section_id\": null,",
      "      \"page_number\": null,",
      "      \"formatted\": null",
      "    }",
